{"sourceUrl":"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/index.php/News/details.html?id=896&sid=2","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.284472+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/index.php/News/details.html?id=896&sid=2","html":"<div>\n<p><span>社会学系</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>年拟接收推荐免试研究生，欢迎本校及外校的优秀应届本科生报名申请。直博专业为社会学、人口学</span><span>（</span><span>学术学位</span><span>），</span><span>硕士专业</span><span>为</span><span>社会工作</span><span>（</span><span>专业学位</span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>1. </span><span>申请条件、报名</span><span>方式</span><span>等详见</span><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28498a3193539/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>《</span><span>浙江大学关于2027年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知</span><span>》</span></a><span>（报名系统学院请选择“公共管理学院”）。</span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span>报名时间为</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>8月10日8:00至</span></strong><strong><span>2026年</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>10</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>24:</span></strong><strong><span>00</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>本校及外校报名方式和截止时间均一致</span></strong><strong><span>。</span><span>）</span></strong></p><p><span>3. </span><span>申请材料</span></p><p><span>（1）</span><span>报名系统上传：</span><span>有效身份证扫描件；</span><span>前六学期</span><span>专业排名证明（所在学校</span><span>/</span><span>院系盖章</span><span>，</span><span>如果截止时间前无法提供前六学期的请按前五学期</span><span>）；本科期间成绩单（所在学校</span><span>/</span><span>院系盖章）；外语水平证明；如果有已发表的学术论文等科研成果，或有科技活动获奖的，请提交证明材料。</span></p><p><span>（2）</span><strong><span>直博申请人</span></strong><span>外语水平原则上需符合以下任意一项</span><span>：</span></p><p><span>①</span><span>全国大学英语六级成绩总分500分及以上。</span></p><p><span>②</span><span>英语专业八级成绩合格。</span></p><p><span>③</span><span>WSK（PETS 5）达到合格标准。</span></p><p><span>④</span><span>雅思（学术类）6.0及以上。</span></p><p><span>⑤</span><span>新托福85及以上。</span></p><p><span>①</span><span>-</span><span>③</span><span>类型的英语成绩在</span><span>202</span><span>2</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月及以后获得方为有效；</span><span>④</span><span>-</span><span>⑤</span><span>类型的英语成绩（不认可家考成绩和拼分成绩）有效期参照证书有效期。</span></p><p><span>（3）</span><strong><span>直博申请人</span></strong><span>须提供至少两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家（或相当专业职称的专家）的书面推荐意见（</span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/5f07d39f9b5684e4021d.gif\"/><a href=\"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/ueditor/php/upload/file/20260807/1786094859271186.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"博士专家推荐书.docx\">博士专家推荐书.docx</a><span>），由专家本人发送有签名的</span><span>PDF</span><span>文件至邮箱</span><span>0918015@zju.edu.cn</span><span>，</span><strong><span>邮件和文件请命名为“博士专家推荐书</span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span>考生姓名</span></strong><strong><span>-</span></strong><strong><span>推荐专家姓名”，截止时间与系统报名截止时间一致（</span></strong><strong><span>202</span></strong><strong><span>6</span></strong><strong><span>年</span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span>10</span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span>24:</span></strong><strong><span>00</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>4. 联系方式</span><span>：0918015@zju.edu.cn</span><span>（</span><span>社会学、人口学</span><span>）；</span><span>syesun@zju.edu.cn</span><span>（</span><span>社会工作</span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>5. </span><span>后续安排请关注社会学系相关通知。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学社会学系</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p> </div>","textSha256":"4cf704039778cf7c4bba070a80482bfd194d760f2dc58c1fa55b0808dc2373f6","textLength":757,"sourceSha256":"9c9544aa1f2934c78f76099e4137d4a8586448b8226750f55237a90053b00c27","selector":".detail_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4ad615cb8f36d77db18a","title":"2026年浙江大学社会学系关于2027年接收推荐免试研究生报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.284472+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://sociology.zju.edu.cn/Public/Resources/js/lib/ueditor/1.4.3/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/5f07d39f9b5684e4021d.gif"}]}
